rmelons, and more soar through the air, just waiting to be sliced apart.\n\nWith intuitive controls, realistic bow mechanics, and vibrant environments, every shot feels satisfying. Challenge yourself in different modes, improve your accuracy, and climb the leaderboard. Whether you\u2019re a casual player looking for some juicy fun or a competitive archer aiming for perfection, this is your ultimate VR fruit-smashing adventure.", "short_description": "Step into the orchard, grab your bow, and take aim! Smash  fruits in this fast-paced VR archery challenge that tests your precision, speed, and focus.\n\n"}]}, "developer_name": "Abstron Pvt Ltd", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tulipapps.com/meta-quest-privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Tulip Apps", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.tulipapps.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24439613852341096"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823746_1164262388874639_520847005373289438_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YR5EQB5dcL8Q7kNvwGcv8B5&_nc_oc=Ado5kDwfrW73pq3FsM-kahSPmbuUzw8J1HlpaetiUkkRjvcNkAC1Npfp790mUpZoGeM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4